Add Stream Deck Dim dial; document software dim in README

Stream Deck +:
- New "Dim Dial" action (dial-dim) — rotate 0-100% to drive the software
  dim overlay via --set-dim=, push to show the popup. Only rotatable when
  HDR is off (HDR uses the SDR Balance dial). Crescent-moon icon.

App:
- App parses --set-dim=; HandleCommand routes it to ApplyDimValue, which
  sets the DimOverlay directly (ignored when HDR is on).
- status.json gains a "dim" field so the dial reads the current level;
  popup dim slider and brightness-raise clears keep it in sync.
- RefreshState no longer wipes an active overlay on a passive refresh — a
  dial-set dim is only cleared by an explicit brightness raise.

README: document the Dim feature (Display card) and the Dim dial.

